      "text": "15. INSTALL SEAT AND RACK GUIDE"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "16. INSTALL RACK GUIDE SPRING AND CAP"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        "Install the rack guide spring.",
        "Coat liquid sealer onto the screw surface of the cap.",
        "Using SST, install the rack guide spring cap."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09612-24012 (09612-10021)",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Using SST to tighten rack guide spring cap",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 22,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "17. ADJUST TOTAL PRELOAD"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        "Tighten the rack guide spring cap with SST and torque it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Rack guide spring cap",
      "value": "250 kg-cm (18 ft-lb, 25 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        "Using SST, return the rack guide spring cap 90°.",
        "Using SST, measure the preload."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09616-00010",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Preload (turning): 9 — 12 kg-cm"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(7.8 — 10.4 in.-lb, 0.9 — 1.2 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If incorrect, readjust."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 3,
      "description": "Installation of rack guide spring cap lock nut using SST",
      "labels": [
        "SST"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 42,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 38,
        "height": 19
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "18. INSTALL RACK GUIDE SPRING CAP LOCK NUT"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        "Coat liquid sealer onto the lock nut and gear housing contact surfaces.",
        "Tighten the rack guide spring cap lock nut and torque it with SST."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "part_number",
      "label": "SST",
      "number": "09612-24012 (09612-10021, 09617-24020)",
      "description": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "torque_spec",
      "component": "Rack guide spring cap lock nut",
      "value": "700 kg-cm (51 ft-lb, 69 N·m)"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        "Recheck the total preload."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "If incorrect, readjust."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Preload (turning): 9 — 12 kg-cm"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "(7.8 — 10.4 in.-lb, 0.9 — 1.2 N·m)"
    },
