      "text": "19. INSTALL DUST COVER"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "20. INSTALL RACK BOOTS, CLAMPS AND CLIPS"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        "Insure that the tube hole is not clogged with grease."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "text": "NOTE: If the tube hole is clogged, the pressure inside the boot will change after it is assembled and the handle turned."
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": true,
      "items": [
        "Install boots."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "text": "NOTE: As the left and right boots are different, be careful not to interchange them."
    },
